Package: klest
Architecture: any
Depends: foot, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: lightweight modular Wayland desktop session
 Klest is an early-stage Wayland desktop environment built around a small
 wlroots compositor and independent Wayland components.

Package: klest-settings
Architecture: any
Depends: klest (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: GTK configuration utility for Klest
 klest-settings provides a graphical editor for Klest's appearance and
 keyboard settings. It is packaged separately so GTK is not required by the
 core session.
